  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Sitka Back-Tailed Deer SurveyI - PWS",
  "description": "Data Type: Mammals; This data set is taken from Prince William Sound transects to monitor Sitka Black-tailed deer populations using pellet-group survey methods. Transects were grouped by the geographic areas of Hawkins Island, Hinchinbrook Island, Montague Island and Western Prince William Sound.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
